{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 75573, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 54129, "uid": 40642, "type": 4, "title": "自选箱使用方法(4.17更新新版2022自选建议)", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1620268237, "updated_at": 1683692850, "updated_uid": 40642, "comment_at": 1686833324, "last_at": 1692614004, "comment_count": 62, "status": 1, "summary": "4.17已更新2022自选箱建议新版：1.更新珀皮塔优先级2.取消滑板的选择推荐，因为船长的数值更加逆天，当你需要WB使用跨属性三人小队时，船长、格利拉、珀皮塔是最优选择，这样滑板就单纯变为了一个为了", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_4375/202/40642/2023/3/17/537356.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_3750/202/40642/2023/0/11/634529.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1620268293897_29700506.jpeg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 38, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 134081, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 38, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 75573, "content": "\n          <div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4.17已更新2022自选箱建议新版：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.<span style=\"color: rgb(221, 10, 217);\">更新珀皮塔优先级</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.<span style=\"color: rgb(221, 10, 10);\">取消滑板的选择推荐</span>，因为船长的数值更加逆天，当你需要WB使用跨属性三人小队时，船长、格利拉、珀皮塔是最优选择，这样滑板就单纯变为了一个为了攻击姿态而存在的水WB限定辅助。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1000\" data-height=\"4375\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_4375/202/40642/2023/3/17/537356.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_4375/202/40642/2023/3/17/537356.png\"></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1000\" data-height=\"3750\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_3750/202/40642/2023/0/11/634529.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1000/h_3750/202/40642/2023/0/11/634529.png\"></div><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1620268293897_29700506.jpeg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1620268293897_29700506.jpeg\" style=\"height: 527px; width: 250px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2280\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1620268298194_5546559.jpeg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1620268298194_5546559.jpeg\" style=\"height: 529px; width: 250px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2280\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 176, 240); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\">自选箱子来源：两周一次的四人池活动、其他各种活动、礼包等，整体很稀少需要谨慎使用。</span></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"p1\"><br></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">2020自选、2019自选箱子用法：</span></span><br></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">注意：同时持有19年与20年自选箱子时：</span></div>\n<div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">20年自选涵盖19年自选的全部角色，所以选一个角色之前检查一下，如果所选为老天子，尽量在19自选中拿取。</span></div></span><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: italic;\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"p2\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">优先级从左到右：</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 150, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"\"><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(241, 150, 0);\">2020自选箱：</span>鲜花（没图鉴时）&gt;六连刀(某属性一个都没开图鉴时)&gt;WB通用辅助、干扰（缺某个没图鉴)&gt;鲜花（没P）&gt;2019自选箱高优先级角色&gt;其他PVP常用干扰、盾=六连刀(已有图鉴)=日历已有的近期活动必上辅助或刀等（没图鉴时）</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div>\n<div class=\"p3\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(251, 161, 13);\"><span class=\"s1\">2019</span>自选箱：</span><span class=\"s1\">&nbsp;牡丹（全场景实用辅助）&gt;</span>夏娃（萌新期通用<span class=\"s1\">,</span>后期<span class=\"s1\">PVP </span>和<span class=\"s1\"> </span>火<span class=\"s1\">WB+</span>火<span class=\"s1\">RAID</span>）<span class=\"s1\">=</span>莫娜<span class=\"s1\">&gt;</span>海王星<span class=\"s1\">=</span>木伞<span class=\"s1\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">&gt;六连刀(某属性一个都没开图鉴时)&gt;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">WB通用辅助、干扰（缺某个没图鉴)&gt;</span></span>其他<span class=\"s1\">PVP</span>常用干扰、教皇<span class=\"s1\">=</span>六连刀<span class=\"s1\">(</span>已有图鉴<span class=\"s1\">)=</span>日历已有的近期活动必上辅助<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; float: none;\">或刀等</span>（没图鉴时）</span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"p3\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div class=\"p3\"><br></div></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 56, 255);\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 56, 255);\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 56, 255);\">鲜花&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602314846226_14106654.png\" style=\"height: 58px; width: 58px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">&nbsp; 夏娃<span style=\"width: 58.6517px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602315560173_7968473.png\" style=\"height: 58px; width: 58.6517px;\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\"></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;莫娜<span style=\"width: 60.6742px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602313708493_78095346.png\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 60.6742px;\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\"></span>&nbsp; 海王星<span style=\"width: 60.6742px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602310173767_12211163.png\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 60.6742px;\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\"></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 56, 255);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 56, 255); height: 57.3556px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602311052944_97311530.png\" style=\"height:57.3556px;width:58px;\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>泡面(此天子已有上位：鲁邦，不建议选，<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">除非没有上位且不愿意等</span>)</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(222, 56, 255);\">木伞<span style=\"height: 60.3222px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602313619464_38481925.png\" style=\"height: 60.3222px; width: 61px;\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\"></span>&nbsp; 宋丹丹<span style=\"width: 58.6378px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1602310041039_62521731.png\" style=\"height: 58px; width: 58.6378px;\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\"></span>&nbsp; 排球<span style=\"height: 53.4px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1