ght: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px; text-indent: 28px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">尤米尔<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614149425645_97931409.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 60px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&gt;墨丘利<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624956005705_86006074.png\" style=\"height: 66px; width: 66px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">&gt;白猫<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612857025730_53912330.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height: 60px; width: 60px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">=玛土撒拉<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616569332394_23507548.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height: 74px; width: 74px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(以上均为没有图鉴时)</span></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">其次优先级：</span>六连刀勒达<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611730481637_54205930.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height: 59px; width: 59px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">、拉佛斯<span style=\"width: 49.0115px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1621321476216_76822954.png\" style=\"height: 52px; width: 49.0115px;\" data-width=\"82\" data-height=\"87\"></span>、岛主<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1626257722578_91199132.png\" style=\"height: 62px; width: 62px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">(以上均为没有图鉴时) 或</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">最高优先级中某天子，想拿重复的追求一个高加。比如鲁邦、轮子妈、暗提裙等。</span></span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">再次优先级：</span>2020自选箱高优先级角色&gt;2019自选箱高优先级角色。</span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 242);\">鲁邦</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1622619955145_12970766.png\" style=\"height: 63px; width: 63px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">: PVE全能大爹，PVP低分段也可上去凑数</span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">轮子妈</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1617779532206_52750109.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:54px;width:54px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">: 点火后暗六连，PVE光活动通用+强，PVP和乱斗也因为破保护BUFF而上场。<br></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">暗提裙</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1618990266165_26670532.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:55px;width:55px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：暗RAID最强刀，乱斗和PVP环境也有不错发挥。<br></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-indent:28px;\">尤米尔</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614149425645_97931409.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-indent:28px;height:6