data-height=\"128\">=白猫<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612857025730_53912330.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height:60px;width:60px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">=玛土撒拉<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616569332394_23507548.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height: 67px; width: 67px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">(以上均为没有图鉴时)</span></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">其次优先级：</span>六连刀勒达<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1611730481637_54205930.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"height:59px;width:59px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">、拉佛斯<span style=\"width:49.0115px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1621321476216_76822954.png\" style=\"height:52px;width:49.0115px;\" data-width=\"82\" data-height=\"87\"></span>、岛主<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1626257722578_91199132.png\" style=\"height:62px;width:62px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">(以上均为没有图鉴时) 或</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">最高优先级中某天子，想拿重复的追求一个高加。比如蒙眼、鲁邦、轮子妈、暗提裙、米拉等。</span></span><br style=\"\"></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\">再次优先级：</span>2020自选箱高优先级角色&gt;2019自选箱高优先级角色。</span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,242);\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 0, 255);\">蒙眼</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636527428183_67207360.png\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 242); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; height: 76px; width: 76px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">: 蒙眼，新晋PVP大爹，乱斗和竞技场人权，首位3体控制，PVP队长技能的永久选择。</span><br></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 0, 255);\">米拉</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 242);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1629887887402_46711717.png\" style=\"height: 64px; width: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">: PVP环境第一刀，数值怪物，手操更加，乱斗需拉条配合。</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 0, 255);\">提泰妮娅</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 242);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1635317640453_43072606.png\" style=\"height: 64px; width: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;\">: RAID对策刀，但是除普巴外仅有的光六连（在光狗来以前），而普巴又是返魂限定，所以选择此刀可以补齐萌新的光属性的PVE能力。</span><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 0, 255);\">兔女郎</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1627464347454_34511197.png\" style=\"height: 63px; width: 63px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：和尤弥尔类似，乱斗环境强势保护盾，竞技场低保及以下也实用。</div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(21, 0, 255);\">吕布<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1628668799799_19686561.png\" style=\"height: 63px; width: 63px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\"></span>：提供魅惑和debuff延长可用于PVP以及wb。同时队长技能减少对面debuff回避非常适合萌新作为wb玩法队长。</div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,242);\">鲁邦</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1622619955145_12970766.png\" style=\"height:63px;width:63px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">: PVE全能大爹，PVP低分段也可上去凑数</span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">轮子妈</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1617779532206_52750109.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:54px;width:54px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">: 点火后暗六连，PVE光活动通用+强，PVP和乱斗也因为破保护BUFF而上场。</span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">暗提裙</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1618990266165_26670532.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:55px;width:55px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：暗RAID最强刀，乱斗和PVP环境也有不错发挥。<br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-indent:28px;\">尤米尔</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1614149425645_97931409.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;text-indent:28px;height:60px;width:60px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：PVP自动党福音，乱斗环境的大爹。<br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">墨丘利</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624956005705_86006074.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:66px;width:66px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：点火后通用WB破防，取代木基佬。<br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">白猫</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1612857025730_53912330.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:60px;width:60px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：WB通用加速手+拉条手。几乎每期都要上。本身也是水RAID对策辅助。<br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">玛土撒拉</span><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1616569332394_23507548.png\" alt=\"å¤©å­å¨å¾é´åè¡¨\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;height:74px;width:74px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">：当前环境相当强力的控制类干扰，PVP和乱斗都要用到。</span></div><br></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638428592417_12683093.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1638428592417_12683093.jpg\" data-width=\"2362\" data-height=\"5500\"></div><br><div></div><div class=\"p1\" style=\"fo